# Project Guidelines

## BoostDev Integration

This project uses [BoostDev](https://github.com/Lockedindev0/boostdev) for Claude Code optimization.

### Active Protections
- **Anti-Loop**: Automatic loop detection after 3 repeated failures
- **Session Memory**: Context is saved/loaded automatically between sessions
- **Token Tracking**: All tool calls are logged for usage analysis

### When You Get a BoostDev Warning
If you see a `[BoostDev] Loop Detected!` message:
1. STOP what you are doing immediately
2. Analyze WHY the previous approach failed
3. Consider a completely different strategy
4. If stuck, ask the user for guidance

### Session Memory
Previous session context is loaded at startup. Use this context to:
- Continue work without re-explaining architecture
- Avoid repeating decisions already made
- Reference previous errors and their solutions

